-- Grapheme cluster boundaries: UAX #29 section 3, as the crate implements it
-- in `src/grapheme.rs`.
--
-- A boundary between two characters is decided by their categories alone
-- (`checkPair`), except for three rules that look further back: GB9c for
-- Indic conjuncts, GB11 for emoji ZWJ sequences, and GB12/13 for pairs of
-- regional indicators. The crate's cursor answers those incrementally, for
-- text that arrives in chunks; with the whole string in hand the answer is
-- the same, and simpler to write down.
--
